@startuml
title WP-004 Domain Services

skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0

class Container <<Aggregate Root>>

package "Domain Services" {
    class BindingValidator <<Stateless>>
    class AliasResolver <<Stateless>>
    class ResolutionEngine <<Stateless>>
    class FactoryResolver <<Stateless>>
}

class ServiceIdentifier <<Value Object>>
class Binding <<Entity>>
class Alias <<Entity>>
class ResolutionContext <<Value Object>>
class ResolutionPath <<Value Object>>

Container --> BindingValidator : validates registration
Container --> AliasResolver : resolves alias chains
Container --> ResolutionEngine : coordinates resolution
BindingValidator --> Binding : validates
BindingValidator --> Alias : validates
BindingValidator --> ServiceIdentifier : validates
AliasResolver --> Alias : traverses
AliasResolver --> ServiceIdentifier : returns canonical id
ResolutionEngine --> Binding : resolves
ResolutionEngine --> ResolutionContext : uses
ResolutionEngine --> ResolutionPath : updates
ResolutionEngine --> FactoryResolver : delegates factory bindings
FactoryResolver --> Binding : invokes factory strategy

note bottom
All Domain Services are stateless.
They preserve aggregate invariants and do not own container state.
end note

@enduml
